Arturo Chian

From uca443e6eaa0e78ed at groups.google.com  Mon Jan  6 21:10:34 2014
From: uca443e6eaa0e78ed at groups.google.com (Joe Cheng)
Date: Mon, 06 Jan 2014 21:10:34 +0000
Subject: Re: [shinyapps-users] Common error: Error in setwd(appDir) : cannot change working directory
Message-ID: <CjTPOGyJSNU.AhB1YgAfFaAJ@shinyapps-users.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <CjTPOGyJSNU.4yB3S7Neqh0J@shinyapps-users.groups.google.com>
References: <CjTPOGyJSNU.4yB3S7Neqh0J@shinyapps-users.groups.google.com>
