There's not currently a mechanism in Shiny to read and write cookies, but also, two distinct Shiny apps would be running in two different R processes, so they wouldn't have access to the same objects (unless you serialize said objects to disk and pass them that way).

Can you talk a little more about your scenario where you want to do this?

