Tim,

It sounds like your application may be running out of memory, causing the application instance to crash. By default, application instances are limited to 256MB of memory. I would read the section of the guide on Application Instances <https://github.com/rstudio/shinyapps/blob/master/guide/guide.md#application-instances> and possibly try increasing size of the instances you are using.

Regards,
-Andy

